# FOUNDRY — STAGE 1: WORKSPACE FOUNDATION

## Project Objective

Develop Foundry into a stable, modular, extensible infinite workspace platform by completing all five foundational development phases.

- Phase 01 — Foundry Foundation
- Phase 02 — Controller Integration
- Phase 03 — Window Management
- Phase 04 — Application Registry
- Phase 05 — Communication Bridge

Complete these phases in sequential dependency order within the existing Foundry codebase.

Do not rebuild the application from scratch. Inspect the current implementation, identify reusable components, and preserve all working functionality.

