## 4.4 Registry Operations

Support operations equivalent to:

```javascript
appRegistry.register(manifest)
appRegistry.unregister(appId)
appRegistry.get(appId)
appRegistry.list()
appRegistry.search(query)
appRegistry.launch(appId, options)
