## 4.5 Application Launching

The application registry should communicate with the Window Manager when launching applications.

```text
Application Launch Request
         ↓
Application Registry
         ↓
Validate Application
         ↓
Resolve Existing Instance
         ↓
Window Manager
         ↓
Mount or Restore Application
         ↓
Return Execution Result
```

Use an adapter for applications that are still managed internally by the Education Controller.

Do not duplicate their existing launch logic.

## 4.6 Application Display Modes

